  "notes": "Cash basis city, same choices as FY2023/FY2024. Governmental from the Total column of the cash-basis governmental funds statement (p4: General + Bond). 'Intergovernmental - state' 290,496 split with the p8 General Fund Intergovernmental breakdown (motor vehicle fee and tax, homestead, pro rate, highway allocation); remainder 11,745 = Library intergovernmental - state 927 (p11) + Bond Fund 10,818 (p4), kept with the parent label. Bond proceeds 1,298,620 and Grants and donations 180,938 printed under Other Financing Sources on p4 -> debt_proceeds and other_financing. Fund balances (p4) recorded as fund balance; ending_cash = Statement of Net Position governmental 'Cash' 10,123,285 (p1; p3 cash in bank 10,113,512 + county treasurer 9,772); beginning cash not printed. Business-type (Water, Sewer) from the accrual proprietary statement p6 Total column (same figures as the Statement of Activities p2); receipts total computed (operating + nonoperating), disbursements total = p2 Total business-type activities disbursements 715,088. Proprietary cash flows (p7) recorded; its Total capital financing figure is misprinted (report_discrepancies). Balance sheet: governmental lines from p3 Total column, business-type lines from p1 Business-type column; totals from p1 Total (memo only). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p8), Bond Fund (p9), proprietary budgetary schedule (p10); the p11 combining schedule of General sub-funds covers the same General Fund money and is not entered (no double counting). p8 'Other miscellaneous' 85,613 vs p4 84,686 (difference 927 = Library state aid, which p8 does not show among Intergovernmental). Zero/dash lines skipped (p8 Municipal equalization budget 0, State aid budget 800; p10 Water debt service, Sewer capital improvements budget 0, Water Bond proceeds budget 1,200,000 with no actual). No transfers printed. Several printed totals off by 1-2 (rounding, report_discrepancies). Read pages 1-11 of 11."
